  "2026-10-18T04:05:29.333Z",codex-agent,"Round 1: issue read in full; searched existing tracker and no issue-specific import exists. Implement in fix/import-and-release-issues from origin/main; add behavioral revert proof and run unchanged npm and Bun release gates with isolated CI identity."
  "2026-10-18T04:08:58.091Z",codex-agent,"Implemented current-poll approval state with a separate unavailable state; successful empty reads clear old approval observations. Actual release-loop shell regressions cover pending-to-running timeout, still-pending timeout with run URL, API read failure, and subsequent verified merge. Reverting only release.yml with tests retained fails 2/4; restored shell passes 4/4. No live merge or publication was performed."
  "2026-10-18T04:21:53.302Z",codex-agent,Run the unchanged npm and Bun release gates on isolated GitHub runners using a temporary read-only validation workflow while local gates continue. Remove the workflow after collecting exact source-head receipts.
  "2026-10-18T04:43:04.458Z",codex-agent,"CI at 7a1b616 passed 824/824 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across 14 authored modules in both npm and Bun release commands, then refused the stale generated changelog ordering. The temporary validation note changed item ordering after generation. Regenerate after every tracker write, verify changelog:check, and rerun both full gates; these runs are failed gate evidence, not acceptance."
  "2026-10-18T04:57:04.097Z",codex-agent,"Issue #145: actual release-loop shell passes 4/4; reverting only release.yml fails 2/4. Pending-to-running, current pending approval, unavailable reads and later successful merge are covered. Both full CI release commands PASS at 956ae58201a9058f19fab2ca6e265b7426374639: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 824/824, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across 14 authored modules. Isolated HOME and global/system Git identity were enforced. Receipts: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39098074518/job/117588542763 and https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39098074518/job/117588542909 . Remove the temporary validation workflow; implementation/tests remain unchanged. Regenerate the changelog after ALL final tracker writes. Item remains in progress and unclaimed for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-18T06:38:48.739Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 review follow-up: no review threads and no CodeRabbit review are present. Read all reviews and all open repository issues; #141/#143/#145 remain linked in the PR body. Merged current main attestation compatibility, with no tracker overlap or merge receipts. Revalidate isolated npm and Bun release checks and fresh-clone strict health, and check review threads again after PR #146."
  "2026-10-18T06:59:08.205Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 integration validation: linked approval-state regressions pass 4/4. Exact npm and Bun release commands pass 836/836 each at 762285d94e90e645927b90e8032292c191772b49, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, all 14 authored modules at exact 100/100/100/100. Fresh-clone strict health passes. Gate receipts: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39105101037 (npm job 117609117351, Bun job 117609117576). Remove the temporary validation workflow; final code, tests, scripts, docs and dependency pins remain identical. No unresolved review threads or substantive CodeRabbit review are present; absent review is not approval. Final-head CI will be recorded in the PR body. No merge or release performed."
