  "2026-10-18T10:42:36.521Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 final review receipt: original current-approval-state diagnostic fix retained after merging #146/#147. Linked approval transition regressions PASS 4/4. Original production-only revert proof remains recorded. Exact isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check both PASS: 893/893 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across 14 authored modules, unchanged thresholds. Hosted receipts: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39119457879 (npm job 117651896197; Bun job 117651896368). Validation commit 059e4f0ed9308c9970ee4af6df941fcda8afe804 differs from source commit 0b6d7cb3eef2d056adecd4c44fa47817b177e6c3 only by a temporary validation workflow. Final-head CI will be reported in the PR. Claims released without closing items; orchestrator owns closure."
